  "goodToKnow": "Die Konvention is a convention in two senses: an international treaty (die UN-Kinderrechtskonvention, die Europäische Menschenrechtskonvention, die Genfer Konventionen) and a social custom: gesellschaftliche Konventionen brechen. A conference is usually der Kongress or die Tagung, not Konvention. Konventionell means conventional, including conventional weapons and farming (as opposed to bio). Plural: die Konventionen."
